    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": " This well-presented two-bedroom ground-floor apartment comes to the market in excellent condition and enjoys a convenient position within the popular Marketpoint development in the heart of Mullingar. Exceptionally well maintained throughout and benefiting from both its own private entrance and access through the communal building, the property offers bright, comfortable accommodation ideally suited to first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a conveniently located town-centre home.\n\nThe accommodation opens with an entrance hall finished with laminate flooring, leading through to the spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. The fitted kitchen has a range of wall and floor units together with an integrated electric oven and hob, extractor fan and tiled splashback. The adjoining living and dining area is finished with laminate flooring and benefits from electric storage heating.\n\nThere are two well-proportioned bedrooms, both finished with laminate flooring. The principal bedroom benefits from electric storage heating and its own en-suite shower room. The en-suite shower was replaced in 2025. A separate main three-piece suite bathroom, with new power shower was fitted to the bathroom in 2025. \n\nThe apartment has also benefited from the installation of new electric storage heaters in 2025.\n\nMarketpoint is a mature and well-established development with professional management in place and ample resident parking. Its central location is a particular advantage, with Mullingar town centre, train station, shops, restaurants and a wide selection of social and essential amenities all within walking distance.\n\nThis attractive apartment represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a low-maintenance home close to the centre of Mullingar. Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall 1.1m x 2.86m (3'7\" x 9'5\") & \n1.4m x 1.38m (4'7\" x 4'6\"): \nLaminate floor. \n\nKitchen/Dining/Living \n2.97m x 3.04m (9'9\" x 10') & \n3.64m x 4.03m (11'11\" x 13'3\"): Laminate flooring, electric storage heating, fitted kitchen, integrated electric oven & hob, extractor fan, tiled splashback.\n\nBedroom One 3.11m x 3.09m (10'2\" x 10'2\"): \nLaminate floor, en-suite, electric storage heating. \n\nEn-Suite 2.07m x 1.15m (6'9\" x 3'9\"): \nTiled floor, WC, wash hand basin, fixed wall mirrors, shower cubicle with pump shower, extractor fan. \n\nBedroom Two 2.69m x 3.95m (8'10\" x 13'): \nLaminate flooring.\n\nStorage 0.64m x 0.99m (2'1\" x 3'3\"): \n\nBathroom 2.13m x 1.95m (7' x 6'5\"): \nTiled floor, WC, wash hand basin, bath, wall mirrors, extractor fan. \n\nSpecial Features & Services\n•Two-bedroom ground-floor corner apartment \n•Excellent condition throughout \n•Bright and well-maintained accommodation \n•Useful storage \n•New electric storage heaters fitted in 2025 \n•New en-suite shower fitted in 2025 \n•New bathroom power shower fitted in 2025 \n•Laminate flooring throughout principal living areas \n•Professional management in place \n•Ample parking within the development \n•Ground-floor accommodation \n•Prime central Mullingar location \n•Walking distance of Mullingar town centre \n•Walking distance of the train station \n•Close to shops, restaurants and everyday amenities \n•Ideal first-time buyer opportunity \n•Excellent investment potential \n•Convenient option for commuters\n\nIncluded\n•Oven\n•Hob\n•Fixtures & fittings\n•Blinds\n•Curtains\n•Kitchen table & chairs\n•Washing machine\n\nBER \nBER C3\nBER No. 104163068"
      },
